[style name="style"]
do GameManager.set_dialogue_on(true)
join director left [animation="Slide From Left" wait="true"]
director: So. You're the student everyone around keeps mentioning.
join main_character right [animation="Slide From Right" wait="true" mirrored="true"]
main_character: It's... me? In the flesh.
director: You're even able to make jokes. How impressive for a robot.
main_character: Sorry, but you must've got the wrong idea. I'm human.
director: No need to fake anymore in front of me, boy. You might have fooled the rest, but not me.
director: But still. I was curious of how far you would get. You even managed to get past my unpaid security guard.
director: And here you are.
director: Tell the student that made you that he's getting the greatest of grades. I'll talk with their professor.
leave director [animation="Slide To Left" wait="true"]
main_character: I will make sure your message is reached. I'm sure my creator will be happy.
leave main_character [animation="Slide To Right" wait="true"]
do GameManager.set_dialogue_on(false)